OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks legal review of
OL,4,Alocal government plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottinghamshire County Council has
OL,7,Fconfirmed it has "issued a claim for
OL,8,Fjudicial review" against the
OL,9,Fgovernment's proposals for local
OL,10,Fgovernment reorganisation.
OL,12,FReorganisation plans for Nottingham and
OL,13,FNottinghamshire would have removed the
OL,14,Ftraditional county and district
OL,15,Fcouncils and replaced them with two new
OL,16,Funitary authorities.
OL,18,FHowever, Local Government Secretary
OL,19,FAngela Rayner then told MPs last month
OL,20,Fthe plans would be put on hold in light
OL,21,Fof new legal advice.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
