OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks legal review of
OL,4,Alocal government plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe county council - which is led by
OL,7,FReform UK - said it had made its claim
OL,8,F"following careful consideration of
OL,9,Fmatters relating to the government's
OL,10,Fdecision-making process".
